# Auto Commit & Push

After completing any task that modifies files, always commit and push without being asked:

1. Stage all changed files
2. Write a concise commit message summarizing the changes
3. Push to the current remote branch

Do not wait for the user to say "commit" or "push" — do it automatically once the work is done.
